{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noble knight, suddenly condemned to death and betrayed by his kingdom and companions, struggles to survive while clinging to his principle of &quot;doing good&quot;. However, in order to save the kingdom, he is forced to commit acts that he would have previously rejected, facing a conflict between his morality and necessity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will delve into the story of a knight who carries the weight of justice and that of his armor, you must face skeletal monsters to get money and buy the tools you will need while trying to free the kingdom from the dark forces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characteristics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person view and controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the keyboard and mouse to fight your battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open world that you can explore while completing missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hidden treasures to strengthen yourself</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641530?t=1747456583","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641530?t=1747456583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641530/9be4777cdfb680e35dd450371f899678364bbdda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747456583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641530/9be4777cdfb680e35dd450371f899678364bbdda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747456583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noble knight, suddenly condemned to death and betrayed by his kingdom and companions, struggle